[TITLE]
EPANET TCV rule actions, premises, and multiple-action branches

[JUNCTIONS]
;ID  Elevation  Demand
J1   0          1.0
M1   0          0.1
M2   0          0.1
M3   0          0.1
M4   0          0.1

[RESERVOIRS]
;ID  Head
R1   30

[PIPES]
;ID          Node1  Node2  Length  Diameter  Roughness  MinorLoss  Status
BaseM1       R1     M1     200     100       120        0          Open
BaseM2       R1     M2     200     100       120        0          Open
BaseM3       R1     M3     200     100       120        0          Open
BaseM4       R1     M4     200     100       120        0          Open
Branch1      R1     M1     100     100       120        0          Open
Branch2      R1     M2     100     100       120        0          Open
SettingSeen  R1     M3     100     100       120        0          Open
OpenSeen     R1     M4     100     100       120        0          Open

[VALVES]
;ID   Node1  Node2  Diameter  Type  Setting  MinorLoss
TCV1  R1     J1     20        TCV   2        0.5

[RULES]
RULE TCV_SETTING_WINDOW
IF SYSTEM TIME >= 1:00
AND SYSTEM TIME < 2:00
THEN VALVE TCV1 SETTING IS 8
AND PIPE Branch1 STATUS IS CLOSED
ELSE VALVE TCV1 SETTING IS 2
AND PIPE Branch1 STATUS IS OPEN
PRIORITY 5

RULE TCV_OPEN_AFTER_TWO_HOURS
IF SYSTEM TIME >= 2:00
THEN VALVE TCV1 STATUS IS OPEN
AND PIPE Branch2 STATUS IS CLOSED
ELSE PIPE Branch2 STATUS IS OPEN
PRIORITY 6

RULE TCV_SETTING_PREMISE
IF VALVE TCV1 SETTING > 7
THEN PIPE SettingSeen STATUS IS CLOSED
ELSE PIPE SettingSeen STATUS IS OPEN
PRIORITY 4

RULE TCV_STATUS_PREMISE
IF VALVE TCV1 STATUS IS OPEN
THEN PIPE OpenSeen STATUS IS CLOSED
ELSE PIPE OpenSeen STATUS IS OPEN
PRIORITY 4

[TIMES]
Duration             3:00
Hydraulic Timestep   1:00
Pattern Timestep     1:00
Report Timestep      1:00
Rule Timestep        0:10

[OPTIONS]
Units       LPS
Headloss    H-W
Trials      100
Accuracy    0.000001

[REPORT]
Status      Full
Summary     No
Nodes       All
Links       All
Demand      Precision 6
Head        Precision 6
Pressure    Precision 6
Flow        Precision 6
Velocity    Precision 6
Headloss    Precision 6

[END]
